      "role": "user",
      "content": "the copper iud sounds intense lol i'm not ready for that. so if i just stick with my current pill and take the st johns wort in the morning like u suggested, can i feel pretty safe about not getting pregnant? i'm not really looking for a big life change, just want to fix my mood. is it actually risky or are people just being dramatic about herbal supplements?",
